 each other well.</i>

00:20:59.657 --> 00:21:02.327
(squeaking)

00:21:02.327 --> 00:21:06.497
<i> They have lots to talk about
 in their ever-changing world.</i>

00:21:06.497 --> 00:21:11.636
(squeaking)

00:21:11.636 --> 00:21:15.106
<i> And the seasons are
 turning once more.</i>

00:21:15.106 --> 00:21:17.575
♪ ♪

00:21:17.575 --> 00:21:22.948
♪ ♪

00:21:22.948 --> 00:21:26.651
<i> Fall is arriving.</i>

00:21:26.651 --> 00:21:30.355 align:start size:94% position:6%
<i> One of the most spectacular
 times of year.</i>

00:21:30.355 --> 00:21:37.362
♪ ♪

00:21:37.362 --> 00:21:43.401
♪ ♪

00:21:43.401 --> 00:21:48.640
♪ ♪

00:21:48.640 --> 00:21:52.644
(squeaking)

00:21:52.644 --> 00:21:59.217
(squeaking)

00:22:02.254 --> 00:22:04.222
<i> At six months old,</i>

00:22:04.222 --> 00:22:07.826
<i> our baby girl still
 depends on mom's milk.</i>

00:22:10.095 --> 00:22:13.932
<i> But she's also developing
 a taste for new things.</i>

00:22:18.870 --> 00:22:21.973 align:start size:91% position:9%
<i> She takes her first bites
 of solid food.</i>

00:22:28.212 --> 00:22:30.882
<i> Tries her hand at grooming.</i>

00:22:37.055 --> 00:22:41.225 align:start size:91% position:9%
<i> And she spends more time
 than ever playing.</i>

00:22:41.225 --> 00:22:46.097
♪ ♪

00:22:46.097 --> 00:22:50.134
<i> Ten times more than
 she did in summer.</i>

00:22:50.134 --> 00:22:51.603
(squeak)

00:22:51.603 --> 00:22:56.841
♪ ♪

00:22:56.841 --> 00:23:00.712 align:start size:91% position:9%
<i> Playing is fun,
 but it's important, too.</i>

00:23:00.712 --> 00:23:03.348 align:start size:84% position:16%
<i> It keeps the monkeys
 fit and strong,</i>

00:23:03.348 --> 00:23:07.819 align:start size:97% position:3%
<i> enhances their social skills,
 and sharpens their brains.</i>

00:23:07.819 --> 00:23:13.524
♪ ♪

00:23:13.524 --> 00:23:16.762
<i> As long as they get
 the landing right.</i>

00:23:19.697 --> 00:23:21.232
<i> In Chinese folklore,</i>

00:23:21.232 --> 00:23:24.602 align:start size:88% position:13%
<i> monkeys represent
 rebellion and mischief.</i>

00:23:24.602 --> 00:23:26.570
(screeching)

00:23:26.570 --> 00:23:29.541 align:start size:88% position:13%
<i> One group that lives up
 to that reputation</i>

00:23:29.541 --> 00:23:31.943
<i> is the troop's bachelor gang.</i>

00:23:36.080 --> 00:23:38.983 align:start position:0%
<i> These young males were evicted
 from their families</i>

00:23:38.983 --> 00:23:41.052
<i> before they turned three.</i>

00:23:44.789 --> 00:23:46.224
(wee)

00:23:49.160 --> 00:23:55.600
(squeaking)

00:23:55.600 --> 00:24:01.072
(squeaking)

00:24:03.274 --> 00:24:07.178
<i> They wrestle endlessly,</i>

00:24:07.178 --> 00:24:08.747
<i> preparing for the day</i>

00:24:08.747 --> 00:24:12.350 align:start size:91% position:9%
<i> they'll fight to try
 to win their own family.</i>

00:24:20.091 --> 00:24:24.195
<i> One of the older bachelors
 has reached that point.</i>

00:24:24.195 --> 00:24:29.067
♪ ♪

00:24:29.067 --> 00:24:31.769 align:start size:84% position:16%
<i> Aged seven,
 the warts on his lips</i>

00:24:31.769 --> 00:24:36.274
<i> show that he's sexually mature.</i>

00:24:36.274 --> 00:24:40.679
<i> Apparently, these warts
 are attractive to females.</i>

00:24:42.647 --> 00:24:48.085
<i> He'll win the right to mate,
 if he can take over a family.</i>

00:24:48.085 --> 00:24:50.054
(squeaking)

00:24:50.054 --> 00:24:56.361
♪ ♪

00:24:56.361 --> 00:25:01.032 align:start position:0%
<i> He's going to try to overthrow
 our baby girl's dad.</i>

00:25:01.032 --> 00:25:03.534
♪ ♪

00:25:03.534 --> 00:25:08.272
♪ ♪

00:25:08.272 --> 00:25:09.808
(squeak)

00:25:12.110 --> 00:25:16.147
<i> Dad and his family
 are under threat.</i>

00:25:16.147 --> 00:25:19.484
<i> Males who take over have
 been known to kill babies,</i>

00:25:19.484 --> 00:25:22.554
<i> so that they can sire
 their own offspring.</i>

00:25:26.825 --> 00:25:30.695 align:start size:88% position:13%
<i> Our baby girl could be
 in grave danger.</i>

00:25:36.467 --> 00:25:40.338 line:0%
(shrieking)

00:25:40.338 --> 00:25:44.676 align:start size:91% position:9% line:0%
<i> A challenger is battling
 our baby girl's dad,</i>

00:25:44.676 --> 00:25:47.478
<i> hoping to take over his family.</i>

00:25:47.478 --> 00:25:52.183
♪ ♪

00:25:52.183 --> 00:25:55.453
<i> If he wins, he could kill her.</i>

00:25:55.453 --> 00:26:01.959
(shrieking)

00:26:01.959 --> 00:26:08.099
(shrieking)

00:26:08.099 --> 00:26:10.201
<i> Dad's an experienced fighter,</i>

00:26:10.201 --> 00:26:13.405 align:start size:94% position:6%
<i> but not as young and strong
 as he used to be.</i>

00:26:16.374 --> 00:26:20.010
<i> What he does have</i>

00:26:20.010 --> 00:26:22.947
<i> is the support of his females.</i>

00:26:22.947 --> 00:26:28.085
(shrieking)

00:26:28.085 --> 00:26:34.525
♪ ♪

00:26:34.525 --> 00:26:37.062
♪ ♪

00:26:42.767 --> 00:26:45.971
<i> The challenger is sent packing.</i>

00:26:49.941 --> 00:26:54.079 align:start position:0%
<i> Dad returns to our baby girl's
 mom for comfort.</i>

00:26:56.781 --> 00:26:58.383
<i> It's thanks to the females</i>

00:26:58.383 --> 00:27:01.553 align:start size:94% position:6%
<i> that he's kept his position
 in the family...</i>

00:27:05.757 --> 00:27:08.793
<i> ...including his mating rights.</i>

00:27:11.795 --> 00:27:14.532
<i> Fall is the breeding season,</i>

00:27:14.532 --> 00:27:17.735 align:start size:88% position:13%
<i> and the female who lost
 her baby in spring</i>

00:27:17.735 --> 00:27:20.105
<i> is ready to mate again.</i>

00:27:24.776 --> 00:27:31.149 align:start position:0%
<i> To win the male's affections
 she showers him with attention.</i>

00:27:31.149 --> 00:27:34.552 align:start size:91% position:9%
<i> Female golden snub-nosed
 monkeys use grooming</i>

00:27:34.552 --> 00:27:39.290 align:start size:88% position:13%
<i> as currency, hoping
 to exchange it for sex.</i>

00:27:39.290 --> 00:27:42.426
♪ ♪

00:27:42.426 --> 00:27:49.233
♪ ♪

00:27:49.233 --> 00:27:53.738 align:start size:94% position:6%
<i> And she seems to be finding
 all the right spots.</i>

00:27:53.738 --> 00:27:58.409
♪ ♪

00:27:58.409 --> 00:28:04.582
♪ ♪

00:28:04.582 --> 00:28:06.184
(squeak)

00:28:10.220 --> 00:28:13.358
<i> They'll mate several times.</i>

00:28:17.361 --> 00:28:21.933 align:start position:0%
<i> But only time will tell if
 she'll give birth next spring.</i>

00:28:28.506 --> 00:28:33.277
♪ ♪

00:28:33.277 --> 00:28:36.681
<i> With fall progressing
 in China's forests,</i>

00:28:36.681 --> 00:28:39.583
<i> trees shed their leaves.</i>

00:28:39.583 --> 00:28:44.122
♪ ♪

00:28:44.122 --> 00:28:48.492 align:start size:94% position:6%
<i> A way to save energy during
 the cold months ahead.</i>

00:28:48.492 --> 00:28:51.262
♪ ♪

00:28:51.262 --> 00:28:58.069
♪ ♪

00:28:58.069 --> 00:28:59.737
<i> With less on offer,</i>

00:28:59.737 --> 00:29:04.042 align:start size:97% position:3%
<i> the monkeys eat bamboo leaves
 and pine needles.</i>

00:29:08.946 --> 00:29:12.650 align:start size:94% position:6%
<i> All the forest's creatures
 get ready for winter.</i>

00:29:12.650 --> 00:29:15.086
♪ ♪

00:29:15.086 --> 00:29:19.890
♪ ♪

00:29:19.890 --> 00:29:22.427 align:start size:84% position:16%
<i> This remote
 high altitude refuge</i>

00:29:22.427 --> 00:29:25.964
<i> is home to over
 90 mammal species.</i>

00:29:29.067 --> 00:29:33.004 align:start size:88% position:13%
<i> But most are secretive
 and seldom seen.</i>

00:29:33.004 --> 00:29:37.808
♪ ♪

00:29:37.808 --> 00:29:41.044
<i> Yellow-throated marten
 search the forest floor</i>

00:29:41.044 --> 00:29:43.581
<i> for fallen fruit and seeds.</i>

00:29:43.581 --> 00:29:49.187
♪ ♪

00:29:49.187 --> 00:29:52.724 align:start size:88% position:13%
<i> The forest provides
 this vital food source,</i>

00:29:52.724 --> 00:29:57.261
<i> and the martens
 return the favor.</i>

00:29:57.261 --> 00:29:59.130
<i> Traveling far and wide,</i>

00:29:59.130 --> 00:30:02.600 align:start size:91% position:9%
<i> they spread seeds
 through their droppings.</i>

00:30:02.600 --> 00:30:04.001
♪ ♪

00:30:04.001 --> 00:30:10.275
♪ ♪

00:30:13.711 --> 00:30:16.981 align:start size:84% position:16%
<i> And seeds disperse
 in more than one way.</i>

00:30:16.981 --> 00:30:19.417
♪ ♪

00:30:19.417 --> 00:30:25.023
♪ ♪

00:30:25.023 --> 00:30:27.691 align:start size:81% position:19%
<i> Some attach to
 the monkeys' coats.</i>

00:30:27.691 --> 00:30:34.365
♪ ♪

00:30:34.365 --> 00:30:38.936
<i> In fall, the monkeys travel
 up to two miles each day,</i>

00:30:38.936 --> 00:30:41.372
<i> spreading the seeds as they go.</i>

00:30:41.372 --> 00:30:46.310
♪ ♪

00:30:46.310 --> 00:30:48.412
<i> The forest's plants and animals</i>

00:30:48.412 --> 00:30:51.816 align:start size:84% position:16%
<i> depend on one another
 for survival.</i>

00:30:51.816 --> 00:30:54.251
♪ ♪

00:30:54.251 --> 00:31:00.858
♪ ♪

00:31:00.858 --> 00:31:04.728 align:start size:84% position:16%
<i> Our baby girl is now
 nine months old,</i>

00:31:04.728 --> 00:31:06.297
<i> and with a thicker coat</i>

00:31:06.297 --> 00:31:09.934 align:start size:94% position:6%
<i> she's ready for
 the harshest time of year.</i>

00:31:09.934 --> 00:31:13.170
♪ ♪

00:31:13.170 --> 00:31:19.844
♪ ♪

00:31:19.844 --> 00:31:24.081 align:start size:97% position:3%
<i> She seems fascinated by
 the first snows of winter...</i>

00:31:24.081 --> 00:31:26.517
♪ ♪

00:31:26.517 --> 00:31:32.890
♪ ♪

00:31:32.890 --> 00:31:36.427
<i> ...and explores
 her frosty world.</i>

00:31:38.195 --> 00:31:40.898
<i> What she doesn't yet know</i>

00:31:40.898 --> 00:31:46.470 align:start size:94% position:6%
<i> is that four months of snow
 lies ahead.</i>

00:31:46.470 --> 00:31:50.842 align:start position:0%
<i> To get through it, she'll need
 to master a new skill,</i>

00:31:50.842 --> 00:31:53.011
<i> unique to these monkeys.</i>

00:31:59.416 --> 00:32:06.123
♪ ♪

00:32:06.123 --> 00:32:12.430
♪ ♪

00:32:12.430 --> 00:32:14.999
<i> As winter temperatures plummet,</i>

00:32:14.999 --> 00:32:18.736 align:start size:94% position:6%
<i> our baby girl seeks comfort
 and warmth with her mom.</i>

00:32:18.736 --> 00:32:21.205
♪ ♪

00:32:21.205 --> 00:32:26.843
♪ ♪

00:32:26.843 --> 00:32:30.181
<i> They can't escape the cold.</i>

00:32:32.683 --> 00:32:34.985
<i> In fact, these monkeys tolerate</i>

00:32:34.985 --> 00:32:37.321 align:start size:84% position:16%
<i> the coldest
 average temperatures</i>

00:32:37.321 --> 00:32:41.425 align:start size:91% position:9%
<i> of any non-human primate
 on the planet.</i>

00:32:41.425 --> 00:32:47.198
♪ ♪

00:32:47.198 --> 00:32:53.303
♪ ♪

00:32:53.303 --> 00:32:57.408
<i> Their dense golden coats
 thicken up in winter...</i>

00:33:01.045 --> 00:33:04.682
<i> ...covering their
 hands and feet.</i>

00:33:07.885 --> 00:33:13.324
<i> And those strange snub noses
 are less exposed to frostbite.</i>

00:33:17.361 --> 00:33:21.732
<i> They also have another
 remarkable adaptation.</i>

00:33:21.732 --> 00:33:27.171
♪ ♪

00:33:27.171 --> 00:33:33.611
♪ ♪

00:33:33.611 --> 00:33:40.451
♪ ♪

00:33:40.451 --> 00:33:42.519 align:start size:91% position:9%
<i> They're the only monkeys
 in the world</i>

00:33:42.519 --> 00:33:46.924 align:start size:84% position:16%
<i> known to travel
 on two legs in snow.</i>

00:33:46.924 --> 00:33:53.364
♪ ♪

00:33:53.364 --> 00:34:00.304
♪ ♪

00:34:00.304 --> 00:34:07.311
♪ ♪

00:34:07.311 --> 00:34:14.318
♪ ♪

00:34:14.318 --> 00:34:17.554
<i> It keeps their hands
 off the cold ground.</i>

00:34:17.554 --> 00:34:22.793
♪ ♪

00:34:22.793 --> 00:34:25.829
<i> And helps them travel faster,</i>

00:34:25.829 --> 00:34:30.434
<i> reducing the time they spend
 in contact with the icy snow.</i>

00:34:30.434 --> 00:34:32.870
♪ ♪

00:34:32.870 --> 00:34:39.310
♪ ♪

00:34:39.310 --> 00:34:46.250
♪ ♪

00:34:46.250 --> 00:34:50.288
<i> Our baby girl reaches
 another milestone...</i>

00:34:52.856 --> 00:34:55.926 align:start size:88% position:13%
<i> ...as she gets the hang
 of this new skill.</i>

00:34:55.926 --> 00:34:58.362
♪ ♪

00:34:58.362 --> 00:35:04.868
♪ ♪

00:35:04.868 --> 00:35:11.842
♪ ♪

00:35:11.842 --> 00:35:14.779
<i> This unique behavior
 could be the source</i>

00:35:14.779 --> 00:35:18.082
<i> of an ancient Chinese legend.</i>

00:35:20.384 --> 00:35:24.322
<i> These forests are said
 to be home to wild men.</i>

00:35:30.561 --> 00:35:36.500 align:start size:94% position:6%
<i> Mysterious ape-like figures
 with red hair,</i>

00:35:36.500 --> 00:35:39.737
<i> who walk upright
 through the trees.</i>

00:35:39.737 --> 00:35:42.172
♪ ♪

00:35:42.172 --> 00:35:47.311
♪ ♪

00:35:47.311 --> 00:35:51.082 align:start size:97% position:3%
<i> Sounds a lot like
 the golden snub-nosed monkey.</i>

00:36:00.857 --> 00:36:06.296 align:start position:0%
<i> Or maybe there really are
 unknown and mysterious wild men</i>

00:36:06.296 --> 00:36:09.900
<i> roaming these forests.</i>

00:36:09.900 --> 00:36:11.402
(bird caws)

00:36:20.444 --> 00:36:22.346 align:start size:88% position:13%
<i> To escape the freezing
 temperatures</i>

00:36:22.346 --> 00:36:27.551 align:start size:91% position:9%
<i> in China's forests,
 some creatures hibernate,</i>

00:36:27.551 --> 00:36:29.420
<i> and others migrate.</i>

00:36:37.527 --> 00:36:40.664
<i> For those who stick around,</i>

00:36:40.664 --> 00:36:43.267
<i> having a strategy is vital.</i>

00:36:46.703 --> 00:36:51.709
<i> This little guy is a sable.</i>

00:36:51.709 --> 00:36:53.844
<i> Rarely seen or filmed,</i>

00:36:53.844 --> 00:36:57.915 align:start size:94% position:6%
<i> he's a smaller cousin of
 the yellow-throated marten.</i>

00:36:59.850 --> 00:37:03.487
<i> Today he's out hunting.</i>

00:37:03.487 --> 00:37:06.924 align:start size:97% position:3%
<i> Using his keen sense of smell
 and sharp hearing</i>

00:37:06.924 --> 00:37:09.627
<i> to search for small prey.</i>

00:37:15.766 --> 00:37:19.203
<i> Large snowshoe-like feet
 help him travel lightly</i>

00:37:19.203 --> 00:37:21.839
<i> on top of the deep snow.</i>

00:37:31.515 --> 00:37:36.353 align:start size:94% position:6%
<i> Winter is the hardest time
 to find food,</i>

00:37:36.353 --> 00:37:39.723
<i> but he's got that covered.</i>

00:37:39.723 --> 00:37:44.962
♪ ♪

00:37:44.962 --> 00:37:49.100 align:start position:0%
<i> When times were good,
 he stockpiled food underground.</i>

00:37:53.170 --> 00:37:56.773 align:start size:88% position:13%
<i> This survival strategy
 is a lifesaver.</i>

00:37:56.773 --> 00:38:03.280
♪ ♪

00:38:03.280 --> 00:38:09.720
♪ ♪

00:38:09.720 --> 00:38:16.226
♪ ♪

00:38:16.226 --> 00:38:19.296 align:start size:97% position:3%
<i> To generate enough body heat
 to stay alive,</i>

00:38:19.296 --> 00:38:21.632 align:start size:84% position:16%
<i> the monkeys now need
 more calories</i>

00:38:21.632 --> 00:38:24.201
<i> than at any other time of year.</i>

00:38:28.205 --> 00:38:30.741 align:start size:88% position:13%
<i> Carbohydrate-rich bark
 and lichens</i>

00:38:30.741 --> 00:38:33.411
<i> become their main
 source of food.</i>

00:38:41.018 --> 00:38:44.521
<i> Diverse gut organisms and
 a multi-chambered stomach</i>

00:38:44.521 --> 00:38:48.759
<i> help them digest
 this tough diet.</i>

00:38:48.759 --> 00:38:53.196
♪ ♪

00:38:53.196 --> 00:38:59.469
♪ ♪

00:38:59.469 --> 00:39:02.039
<i> As winter reaches
 its coldest point,</i>

00:39:02.039 --> 00:39:06.510
<i> the temperature plunges
 to -4 degrees Fahrenheit.</i>

00:39:06.510 --> 00:39:11.415
(wind blowing)

00:39:11.415 --> 00:39:14.885
<i> The monkeys could
 freeze to death.</i>

00:39:17.054 --> 00:39:20.391 align:start size:84% position:16%
<i> They need another way
 to stay warm.</i>

00:39:28.032 --> 00:39:29.867 line:0%
<i> In the depths of winter,</i>

00:39:29.867 --> 00:39:32.369 align:start size:81% position:19%
<i> our baby girl
 and family struggle</i>

00:39:32.369 --> 00:39:34.771
<i> in subzero temperatures.</i>

00:39:34.771 --> 00:39:41.244
♪ ♪

00:39:41.244 --> 00:39:47.684
♪ ♪

00:39:47.684 --> 00:39:51.588 align:start size:91% position:9%
<i> But luckily, they have
 another way to keep warm.</i>

00:39:51.588 --> 00:39:57.561
♪ ♪

00:39:57.561 --> 00:40:03.601
♪ ♪

00:40:03.601 --> 00:40:05.936
<i> Sharing body heat.</i>

00:40:05.936 --> 00:40:11.508
♪ ♪

00:40:11.508 --> 00:40:17.681
♪ ♪

00:40:17.681 --> 00:40:21.619 align:start size:94% position:6%
<i> These affectionate monkeys
 huddle all year round,</i>

00:40:21.619 --> 00:40:26.623 align:start size:84% position:16%
<i> but they do it
 much more in winter.</i>

00:40:26.623 --> 00:40:30.327 align:start size:94% position:6%
<i> Their lives depend on being
 surrounded by family...</i>

00:40:33.430 --> 00:40:35.499
<i> ...or fellow bachelors.</i>

00:40:35.499 --> 00:40:40.871
♪ ♪

00:40:40.871 --> 00:40:42.339
(squeak)

00:40:44.841 --> 00:40:49.179
<i> Our baby girl hides out
 in the warmest spot...</i>

00:40:49.179 --> 00:40:53.750
♪ ♪

00:40:53.750 --> 00:40:59.189
♪ ♪

00:40:59.189 --> 00:41:02.827 align:start size:84% position:16%
<i> ...until it's safe
 to venture out again.</i>

00:41:07.431 --> 00:41:11.268
(chirping)

00:41:11.268 --> 00:41:13.537
(squeak)

00:41:13.537 --> 00:41:19.376
(birds chirping)

00:41:19.376 --> 00:41:24.815
♪ ♪

00:41:24.815 --> 00:41:31.254
♪ ♪

00:41:31.254 --> 00:41:37.694
♪ ♪

00:41:37.694 --> 00:41:41.331 align:start size:84% position:16%
<i> Winter's long silence
 is finally broken.</i>

00:41:41.331 --> 00:41:46.436
♪ ♪

00:41:46.436 --> 00:41:50.507 align:start size:97% position:3%
<i> It's a time of transformation
 and celebration.</i>

